{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6f1bb3da738f01765baee5d5db7407111dd65915b7ab8e189c81fa0d459a076", "ja": "（美希の新衣装が届いた。\n今回は探偵服をモチーフにしたデザインだが……）", "zh": "（美希的新服装送到了。\n这次的设计是以侦探服为主题，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "565aaa5aaa42f446d169fcfb4acf3a91edfc09f4cfddbc21320edc41d923fd27", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。衣装を見に来たの？\nもう書類整理のお仕事、全部終わった？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。是来看我的新衣服的吗？\n整理文件的工作已经全部做完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1002_p", "source_sha256": "59aa2cbf71f2b6171e86ced4903fcfce736a822e5f88877412eda27bd6884f00", "ja": "ああ、全部片づけたよ……って、ん？\n書類の仕事してたなんて言ったっけ？", "zh": "啊，已经全部处理完了……嗯？\n我有说过自己在做整理文件的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "6be57aff016143e7454015a00bba23369ce3c566cd685e88b386ba2fe35b6b3b", "ja": "あと、今日はまだ、お昼ご飯食べてないよね？\nご飯抜きは体によくないの～。", "zh": "还有，你今天还没吃午饭吧？\n不吃饭对身体不好哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "bb240b6d0a964fd13dba070345bc46dcd0b1184f05b91dfb81c738bbd76585bb", "ja": "フィッティングが終わったら、一緒にお昼にしようよ！\nミキのおにぎり……は、分けてあげられないけど。", "zh": "试装结束后，一起去吃午饭吧！\n美希的饭团……虽然不能分给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ed240fc950f94e1ad0cc882da24bd9891466ca9740a55d88ffb77e9e9087940c", "ja": "いやいや、ちょっと待て。どうして美希が、\nそこまで俺の行動を把握してるんだ？", "zh": "不不，等等。美希怎么会\n把我的行踪摸得这么清楚啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe39eb882bee4f5342c49bae88428ca0c298004b583dfdc488f8d0d45527238c", "ja": "……、あはっ☆", "zh": "……，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f646797f673a0d280861f46abacd7bf5472f31ee7e0b39ca61b79bba865db72e", "ja": "いや、笑ってごまかすんじゃなくて！\n……まさか、どこかでこっそり見てたのか？", "zh": "不对，别想用笑来蒙混过去！\n……难道你躲在什么地方偷偷看着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "5fa57834a0d76559913c0af0f720aab99f148ccc159cfff55f4fe96db85ce4fb", "ja": "正解なの☆\nだって今回のミキ、探偵の役を演じるでしょ？", "zh": "答对了☆\n因为这次美希要出演侦探嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
