{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5e61bae714181e30fc1149845cf8a6108e35d1b971fb5a95039133b4d0ba697d", "ja": "まあ、起こったら困るけどな……。", "zh": "不过，真发生了也会很麻烦啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "92f16acc781c74b51ed80f17d0cc12bb9cfdb727506bf84dfae199ba1e7637a4", "ja": "だからね、{$P$}を\n尾行することにしたんだよ。", "zh": "所以呢，决定跟踪{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "2de475ab11bd4845bc959d8aeeb78bac55e6263f6e8bf265be59e38c9ba5cf12", "ja": "ミキ、ハニーのこともっと知りたいし。\n浮気してないかも調べられるし……。", "zh": "美希还想更多地了解亲爱的。\n也能调查一下亲爱的有没有出轨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ff1ede65785b0975f425b7b7cfe7aa95d3d5fd67bad673fb335232a5ed38cffe", "ja": "いや、浮気って……まあいいや。\nそれで結局、役作りにはなったのか？", "zh": "不，什么出轨……算了。\n话说回来，结果对你揣摩角色有帮助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0574_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "eedc091b92d596953f960a12633ba8ccb2f31279c5d1c6efe03cae7c100d5e75", "ja": "ん～……。\nミキは、けっこう楽しかったかも？", "zh": "嗯～……\n美希觉得，好像还挺开心的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
